From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Trouble Makers <noreply@example.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 13:09:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add save-state support hooks

wait_for_rsp_idle() tracks submitted RSP/RDP tasks until their completion
message is enqueued. deliver_pending_external_messages() and the deferred
message accessors let a host flush and snapshot pending events. Overlays
expose the loaded code-section list and can re-register a saved one.
